{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32152","headline":"东郊行 · 温庭筠","name":"东郊行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鬬鸡台下东西道，柳覆班骓蝶萦草。\n坱霭韶容鏁澹愁，青筐叶尽蚕应老。\n绿渚幽香生白苹，差差小浪吹鱼鳞。\n王孙骑马有归意，林彩着空如细尘。\n安得人生各相守，烧船破栈休驰走。\n世上方应无别离，路傍更长千株柳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32152.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32152","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}